    "title": "Man Indicted on charges in Gretchen Fleming case waives extradition in North Carolina - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By MetroNews Staff ,\n6 hours ago PARKERSBURG, W.Va. –A man charged in the disappearance and murder of Gretchen Fleming waived his extradition hearing in North Carolina. According to court documents, Preston Pierce, 58, had submitted a waiver of extradition on Thursday, May 28. His original extradition hearing was scheduled for June 5. Pierce was arrested... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
